    skos:definition "The closed sizes a folded sheet is sold as — what the trade calls a «DL flyer» or «Lang-DL». The format is the closed size; how the sheet is divided into panels is the setup model's business."@da,
        "Die geschlossenen Maße, in denen ein gefalzter Bogen verkauft wird — «DIN lang», «Lang-DL». Das Format ist das geschlossene Maß; die Panelaufteilung gehört zum Setup-Modell."@de,
        "The closed sizes a folded sheet is sold as — what the trade calls a «DL flyer» or «Lang-DL». The format is the closed size; how the sheet is divided into panels is the setup model's business."@en,
        "The closed sizes a folded sheet is sold as — what the trade calls a «DL flyer» or «Lang-DL». The format is the closed size; how the sheet is divided into panels is the setup model's business."@es,
